                "text": "One of the main goals of the White House Conference on Hunger, Nutrition, and Health is to integrate nutrition and health. \n\nThat's why @RepMcGovern and I introduced the #EATforHealth Act to provide medical professionals recurring training in nutrition education and awareness.",
